   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<br>You are using COULEUR<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span> for the fill andbCD_COULEUR<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span> for the legend colours. <br><br>To supply data for an example please use dput().  It produces an easily used data set.  The data as you supplied is is very difficult to use.<br><br><br>On Sunday, July 1, 2012 9:30:08 AM UTC-4, Anthony wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m a new ggplot user and I got problems using scale_fill_manual function.</div><div><br></div><div>Here is the head of the data.frame Resultat which I want to ggplot :</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"> CODE_CULTURE                CULTURE CD_COULEUR SURF_DPT60\r\n1            0      PAS D&#39;INFORMATION    #800080         NA\r\n2            1             BLE TENDRE    #FFFF90     1490.6\r\n3            2 MAIS GRAIN ET ENSILAGE    #00FF00      676.8\r\n4            3                   ORGE    #F0FF70      289.5\r\n5            4        AUTRES CEREALES    #DAEB00        1.9\r\n6            5                  COLZA    #FFECB0      195.4\r\n  Tx_DPT60 SURF_DPT76 Tx_DPT76 SURF_DPT80 Tx_DPT80 SURF_TOTALE\r\n1       NA         NA       NA        0.0      0.0         0.0\r\n2     33.4     6901.0     29.7     9581.6     38.5     17973.2\r\n3     15.2     3160.6     13.6     3371.7     13.5      7209.1\r\n4      6.5     2157.6      9.3     2373.1      9.5      4820.2\r\n5      0.0       87.1      0.4      123.1      0.5       212.1\r\n6      4.4     1124.4      4.8     1500.2      6.0      2820.0\r\n  Tx_TOTAL\r\n1      0.0\r\n2     34.2\r\n3     13.7\r\n4      9.2\r\n5      0.4\r\n6      5.4</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">The column CD_COULEUR contains the fill value I want for each culture.</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">When I do :</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">ggplot(Resultat, aes(x = CULTURE, y = Tx_TOTAL, fill=CULTURE)) +\r\n  geom_bar(width = 0.9) +\r\n  scale_fill_manual(name=&quot;LEGENDE&quot;,values = Resultat$CD_COULEUR, labels=Resultat$CULTURE)<br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">I obtain the following image : </pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kOc1KZknXsE/T_BQESTuBHI/AAAAAAAAAAc/762Fi7tpqyw/s1600/Rplot.jpeg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kOc1KZknXsE/T_BQESTuBHI/AAAAAAAAAAc/762Fi7tpqyw/s1600/Rplot.jpeg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792375385505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1AAvpD0G12DsBmCEYV5y9T\"><img width=\"320\" border=\"0\" height=\"257\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">My problem is that the legend as got the right colour for the right name but the colour use to fille the diagram are not the right one (eg. data at 34 is &quot;BLE TENDRE&quot; and not &quot;COLZA&quot;).</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">Can anybody explain me what is wrong and how can I have the right colour for the right data ?</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">Regards,</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">Anthony</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><br></pre></span></div></blockquote>"
